+    - Once all primary rays are drawn, find every 4-connected black region that does not touch the grid edge and fill it grey.
+    - For each filled region, inspect the turn-generated gap candidates. If exactly one black candidate from the traced turns touches that filled region's boundary, emit a grey secondary ray from that gap in the turn's outward direction until the next non-black cell or the grid edge.
